+
+The tray adapts the community suckless systray patch, including work by Jan
+Christoph Ebersbach, Eon S. Jeon and subsequent contributors; the inspected
+20260516 revision is by Bakkeby. The original diff, checksum and full provenance
+are retained in the coordinator's patches/upstream/dwm/ and patches/README.md.
+This version embeds the tray as a bar child, keeps icons separate from normal
+clients, bounds icon sizes, honors hidden icons and does not steal another tray.
+Native RandR events replace external panel polling/restarts. The private
+_WM_SYSTRAY root CARDINAL pair (dwm PID, tray window) signals successful ownership
+to the supervisor and is removed on cleanup or selection loss.
 
